# 6. redirect()

Used inside:

```txt
Server Components
Layouts
Server Actions
```

Example:

```tsx
import { redirect } from "next/navigation";

const user = await getCurrentUser();

if (!user) {
  redirect("/login");
}
```

### Characteristics

```txt
Server-side redirect
Stops execution immediately
Protected route navigation
```

### Flow

```txt
Request
↓
Server checks auth
↓
redirect("/login")
↓
User never sees protected page
```

### Use Cases

```txt
Protected pages
Protected layouts
Role-based layouts
Authentication checks
```

### Important

```txt
redirect() throws internally
Nothing after redirect() executes
```

Example:

```tsx
redirect("/login");

console.log("never runs");
```

