# Navigation Decision Guide

Use Link when:

```txt
Normal page links
Navbar
Sidebar
Menu
```

Use router.push() when:

```txt
Navigate after user action
Keep history
```

Use router.replace() when:

```txt
Login
Register
Logout
Auth redirects
```

Use redirect() when:

```txt
Server-side auth protection
Layouts
Server actions
```

Use permanentRedirect() when:

```txt
SEO migration
URL permanently changed
```

Use NextResponse.redirect() when:

```txt
proxy.ts
Route handlers
Global route blocking
```

Use proxy.ts when:

```txt
Need request-level protection
Prevent access before page loads
Handle back-button auth issues
```

